28,0:01:45.41,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:01:44.32,0:01:45.41,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.35,0:01:45.58,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 2,0:01:44.39,0:01:45.58,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,pDialogue: 2,0:01:44.42,0:01:45.58,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,!Dialogue: 3,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.71,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,StartDialogue: 3,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.71,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,StartDialogue: 3,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.71,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,StartDialogue: 3,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.71,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,StartDialogue: 3,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.71,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,StartDialogue: 3,0:01:45.41,0:01:45.88,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 3,0:01:45.41,0:01:45.88,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 3,0:01:45.41,0:01:45.88,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 3,0:01:45.41,0:01:45.88,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 3,0:01:45.41,0:01:45.88,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 3,0:01:45.58,0:01:46.37,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,up!Dialogue: 3,0:01:45.58,0:01:46.37,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,up!Dialogue: 3,0:01:45.58,0:01:46.37,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,up!Dialogue: 3,0:01:45.58,0:01:46.37,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,up!Dialogue: 3,0:01:45.58,0:01:46.37,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,up!Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:55.79,Title,,0,0,0,,FiredDialogue: 0,0:01:56.54,0:01:59.71,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! I know who that swordsman is!Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.71,0:02:03.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's one of Straw Hat's underlings, Pirate Hunter Zoro!Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.49,0:02:05.74,Main,,0,0,0,,They called you an underling.Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.74,0:02:09.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, you're even lower than that, right, "Pirate A"?Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:10.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.95,0:02:12.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, "B."Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:13.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:16.98,Main,,0,0,0,,If I had a bounty, it'd be at least twice as much as yours!Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.98,0:02:17.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, "C."Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.93,0:02:19.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen to what I'm saying, you bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.83,0:02:21.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it, you two.Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.81,0:02:23.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Sogeking, they can't hear you.Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:25.81,Main,,0,0,0,,This is part of my plan, Chopper-kun.Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.81,0:02:27.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't know that.Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.11,0:02:27.85,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.95,0:02:30.39,Main,,0,0,0,,There are more of them in the train!Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.39,0:02:31.22,Main,,0,0,0,,They found us!Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.22,0:02:33.93,Main,,0,0,0,,There have to be more! Blow it up before they come out!Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.93,0:02:36.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold it! Nami-san is still in there!Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.34,0:02:37.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:47.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Those bastards!  I'm gonna cut them into pieces!Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:48.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold on, "Pirate A".Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.17,0:02:50.09,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.09,0:02:52.53,Main,,0,0,0,,An attack like that isn't enough to take someone like her out.Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.53,0:02:55.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You're only "Pirate A" because you don't understand something as obvious as that.Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.93,0:02:58.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You damn Moss Head!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:03.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Boy, that scared me!Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:07.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Sogeking?Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:10.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I-I'm okay, Chopper-kun.Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.81,0:03:12.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop firing!Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:14.31,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.63,0:03:15.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at that!Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.57,0:03:17.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Hello!Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:20.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it! I'm a senior citizen!Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.39,0:03:24.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a child and here is a small animal! We're weak!Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.57,0:03:31.55,Main,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat Pirates threatened me and made me operate the train!Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.55,0:03:33.35,Main,,0,0,0,,They did!Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.21,0:03:41.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Who lets their hostages drink?Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:44.51,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close!  We almost killed the hostages, too!Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.51,0:03:49.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Of all people, to think that those pirates took a senior, a child, and a small animal hostage...Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:50.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:54.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that? That smoke looks like a cloud.Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:57.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Using cool balls and heat balls,Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.21,0:04:00.73,Main,,0,0,0,,the moisture in the air is turned into clouds.Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.06,0:04:05.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami-swan! So you escaped the attack!Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:08.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, that cloud is getting bigger and bigger.Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.91,0:04:12.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Grandma, Grandma. That cloud is getting bigger.Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.83,0:04:16.63,Main,,0,0,0,,That cloud looks a little dangerous.Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.63,0:04:19.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Chimney, Gonbe. Come this way.Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It sure wasn't named the "Perfect Clima-Tact" for nothing.Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:27.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It develops much bigger clouds now, and it does it much faster, too.Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:32.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm gonna see how powerful its thunderbolt is.Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.07,0:04:38.12,Main,,0,0,0,,That lady's gonna do something! We might wanna get out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.12,0:04:40.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:45.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Thunderbolt Tempo!Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:05:02.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Nooo!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.18,0:05:03.86,Main,,0,0,0,,It's attacking everyone! We'll die, too!Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:05.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Sogeking!Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:07.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Why'd you hit Sogeking, Nami?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:10.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:14.18,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Don't take it out on me. The problem lies in how you're using it.Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.57,0:05:18.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Besides, Usopp-kun says that he doesn't remember adding that feature!Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:20.27,Main,,0,0,0,,At any rate...Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:24.52,Main,,0,0,0,,that thing is crazy powerful! You brought down a bunch of them.Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.58,0:05:28.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah...Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:29.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:31.65,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do that for?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.65,0:05:33.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Apologize to him, Sogeking!Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:35.47,Main,,0,0,0,,You apologize, idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.47,0:05:40.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami-san! That reminded me of the shock I had the first time I met you!Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:42.87,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with that crew?Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.87,0:05:47.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought that girl was here just for support, but she sure can fight.Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.49,0:05:53.46,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, where's that idiot who rushed out by himself?Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:57.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Beats me... This island isn't small, so if we're going to find him...Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:05:58.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:03.65,Main,,0,0,0,,He's definitely over there!Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.61,0:06:06.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, then...Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:08.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Shall we go after him?Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.01,0:06:19.84,Main,,0,0,0,,They're mere pirates... how dare they cause a ruckus!Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.19,0:06:21.73,Main,,0,0,0,,They won't get away with this!Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.83,0:06:24.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:27.94,Captions,,0,0,0,,Enies Lobby Main IslandDialogue: 0,0:06:38.61,0:06:41.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:42.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Spear!Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.66,0:06:49.42,Main,,0,0,0,,He jumped onto the tree!Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:55.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Those jerks! This is endless! I can't move forward!Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.67,0:06:57.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, this way!Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.45,0:06:59.84,Main,,0,0,0,,They're running in the opposite direction?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.23,0:07:02.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Half of you guys, head to the main island front gate!Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:07.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirates broke open the gate and are invading! Stop them at any cost!Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.24,0:07:11.53,Main,,0,0,0,,They must be here! Good! That makes things a bit easier!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.77,0:07:13.85,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.85,0:07:15.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, you missed!Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.27,0:07:16.92,Main,,0,0,0,,He's over there! Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.92,0:07:20.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island, In Front of the Island GateDialogue: 0,0:07:24.01,0:07:25.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's the matter?Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.24,0:07:29.57,Main,,0,0,0,,We have guests.Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.56,0:07:43.41,Main,,0,0,0,,We Watchdogs are the guards of the front gate!Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.87,0:07:48.01,Main,,0,0,0,,No one can cross this line!Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:50.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Just give up, you damn criminals!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.53,0:08:05.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're completely surrounded.Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.80,0:08:07.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that I look a little closer, there are too many enemies!Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:10.83,Main,,0,0,0,,So what?Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.24,0:08:15.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You sure are cocky! Guys, get them!Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:24.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Grab hold!Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:46.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you could've at least let us have a little fun...Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:47.15,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:50.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't forget why you came here.Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:52.51,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't where you should be focusing your energy.Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.06,0:08:57.09,Main,,0,0,0,,It's true that it'd take a whole day to fight this many enemies.Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:03.06,Main,,0,0,0,,They're quite energetic.Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:05.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't die, okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.66,0:09:07.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Charge ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.39,0:09:13.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Guards! Get back!Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.41,0:09:17.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a King Bull from Water 7! Prepare the cannons immediately!Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:21.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.46,0:09:30.76,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got one more!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.23,0:09:36.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Watchdogs! Get back in formation!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.85,0:09:38.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:43.15,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't let you go! Our dogs are faster than your fish!Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.27,0:09:46.86,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad! They're gonna try jumping on!Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.86,0:09:47.65,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.03,0:09:49.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Can't we go faster?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.35,0:09:50.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, cook guy.Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.93,0:09:51.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:54.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:57.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Take the reins.Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:01.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? You guys...Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.75,0:10:18.57,Main,,0,0,0,,When you see those guys... tell them...Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:22.55,Main,,0,0,0,,"You're fired."Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.03,0:10:25.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure will.Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.07,0:10:27.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Jump onto it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.63,0:10:30.23,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't let you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:33.02,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll leave them to you, Galley-La!Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:35.74,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll skewer you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.74,0:10:38.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Half-Knot Air Drive!Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:49.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! S-Some Watchdogs were taken out!Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:52.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Those fools! They let their guard down!Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:56.53,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way ordinary people can match our speed. Go!Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.53,0:10:57.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:11:01.86,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll pierce you before you notice!Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.44,0:11:11.40,Main,,0,0,0,,More went down!Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.29,0:11:13.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with them?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.89,0:11:20.58,Main,,0,0,0,,They're strong!Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.71,0:11:30.94,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of these guys.Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.94,0:11:34.93,Captions,,0,0,0,,Enies Lobby Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:11:44.01,0:11:48.98,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems that your temperament hasn't changed at all, huh, Cutty Flam?Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.98,0:11:54.40,Main,,0,0,0,,If I had realized sooner that you were alive and had the blueprints,Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:56.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have had to go through all this trouble...Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.35,0:12:03.71,Main,,0,0,0,,since we could just have brought you in for your past crimes!Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.61,0:12:10.97,Main,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, your fellow disciple Iceburg was a hassle.Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.54,0:12:12.79,Main,,0,0,0,,After Tom died,Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:19.19,Main,,0,0,0,,he brought the shipbuilding companies in Water 7 together and organized a big company by himself.Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.19,0:12:23.35,Main,,0,0,0,,And then, he approached the World Government, which he must've had a grudge against,Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.90,0:12:28.80,Main,,0,0,0,,and soon his company established its position as a purveyor to the World Government.Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.69,0:12:32.74,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the president of the shipbuilding company Galley-LaDialogue: 0,0:12:32.74,0:12:35.84,Main,,0,0,0,,and the mayor of the city of water, Water 7.Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.33,0:12:41.44,Main,,0,0,0,,After he became a figure that everyone supported and that was indispensable to the Government,Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:45.67,Main,,0,0,0,,we couldn't meddle with him carelessly.Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.73,0:12:51.61,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I heard that your company contracts to build ships for the World Government!Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.61,0:12:55.14,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Give me a break! I'm not gonna tolerate it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:12:59.42,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's why he's been contracting with the Government...Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.42,0:13:02.88,Main,,0,0,0,,He was a smart man.Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.25,0:13:08.93,Main,,0,0,0,,However, the winds started blowing in my favor.Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:14.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Just when I couldn't wait any longer and was about to take forceful measures...Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.39,0:13:17.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Admiral Aokiji sent me the good news...Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,that Nico Robin was headed to Water 7 on a pirate ship.Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:28.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I drank a cup of coffee to calm myself downDialogue: 0,0:13:29.13,0:13:34.60,Main,,0,0,0,,and put all the conditions,  including a Buster Call, into the plan of operations.Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:38.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, there was a bit of change in the plans,Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:45.67,Main,,0,0,0,,but look! Both triggers for the ancient weapon's revival are here!Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.67,0:13:54.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you get it? The winds of the entire world over are blowing in my favor.Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.25,0:14:07.38,Main,,0,0,0,,A power strong enough to give me control over any large country I might desire is in my hands now!Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.07,0:14:13.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did Aokiji give you the authority to exercise a Buster Call?Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.37,0:14:23.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.05,0:14:39.78,Main,,0,0,0,,You're in no position to ask me questions, you insolent woman!Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:44.28,Main,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't recognized the value of your existence,Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.28,0:14:46.23,Main,,0,0,0,,it would've been practically worthless!Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.82,0:14:52.52,Main,,0,0,0,,So you should be thankful to me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.11,0:14:58.66,Main,,0,0,0,,You, the repugnant kin of Ohara, the land of devils...Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:01.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, listen good.Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.81,0:15:08.79,Main,,0,0,0,,From here on, you'll suffer pain so severe that you will wish many times for death to come,Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.79,0:15:10.88,Main,,0,0,0,,so prepare yourself.Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.88,0:15:12.23,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll hurt you,Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.58,0:15:13.51,Main,,0,0,0,,use you,Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:15.40,Main,,0,0,0,,and throw you away into the sea.Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.86,0:15:19.01,Main,,0,0,0,,That is how deeply sinful your existence itself is!Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.93,0:15:28.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right. I got a call earlier.Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:36.12,Main,,0,0,0,,They reported that some morons have infiltrated our island just to get back worthless trash like you.Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.67,0:15:38.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...!Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.62,0:15:44.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, they should all be caught by now.Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:47.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat Luffy and his crew.Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.15,0:15:51.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do those kids...Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.61,0:15:59.19,Main,,0,0,0,,They seemed no better than trash in front of the 10,000 Enies Lobby soldiers.Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.19,0:16:03.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, we're about to send a ship to the prison.Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:05.24,Main,,0,0,0,,They're a good gift.Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.24,0:16:10.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take them to Impel Down together with Cutty Flam.Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.89,0:16:18.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! That's not what we agreed upon!Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.34,0:16:23.26,Main,,0,0,0,,In return for my cooperation, you were supposed to let them escape safely!Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.91,0:16:35.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you flying off the handle for?Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.71,0:16:39.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucci! Tell us exactly what the condition that we offered her was.Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:46.84,Main,,0,0,0,,That the six Straw Hats, excluding Nico Robin, would leave Water 7 safely.Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.84,0:16:51.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right. There's no mistake in that, right?Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.60,0:17:04.14,Main,,0,0,0,,They came here after leaving Water 7 safely, right?Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:07.63,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.61,0:17:12.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me... that you're going to break the deal using such twisted logic!Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.91,0:17:18.48,Main,,0,0,0,,They're hopeless scum. They don't have a shred of morality in them.Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.01,0:17:21.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? What'd you say?Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:25.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you trash!Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:30.41,Main,,0,0,0,,To start with, we don't even have to keep our promises with you criminals!Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:32.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this! Take this! You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:33.99,Main,,0,0,0,,You too!Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.37,0:17:37.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get so cocky, you bitch!Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.98,0:17:43.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Even the Navy openly uses tricks to capture pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:17:58.64,Main,,0,0,0,,You dirty coward...Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.26,0:18:06.32,Main,,0,0,0,,To think that you're still talking back...Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:09.34,Main,,0,0,0,,You've been betraying people all this time.Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.34,0:18:12.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't think that you can choose an ideal way to die now.Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.37,0:18:25.68,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys can all die together.Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:30.11,Main,,0,0,0,,All are powerless before the supreme power of justice.Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:40.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that commotion?Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:49.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Something is coming!Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.08,0:19:06.03,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, Sodom, Gomorrah! Keep charging ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.15,0:19:12.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! So they're the pirates who broke open the main island's gate?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.87,0:19:15.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire! Keep firing!Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:17.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.31,0:19:19.38,Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't wanna die, get out of our way!Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:21.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this! Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.09,0:19:25.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Withdraw briefly and restore formation!Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.37,0:19:31.80,Main,,0,0,0,,You're mere pirates! Don't get so cocky!Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:40.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Be prepared, pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.07,0:19:42.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Nooo!Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.14,0:19:46.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat you!Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:48.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get on without permission!Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.97,0:19:52.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Things are going smoothly!  Good thing we've got you guys on our side!Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:55.13,Main,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you to get us to Luffy, King Bulls!Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:03.81,Main,,0,0,0,,After him! Don't let him get away! The enemy is alone! Surround him!Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.78,0:20:05.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:08.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Get outta my way!Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:11.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way!Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.04,0:20:18.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.56,0:20:22.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander! He's really scary!Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:26.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't flinch, you idiot! Go!Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.43,0:20:30.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander!Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.61,0:20:38.19,Main,,0,0,0,,That... looks like a dead end.Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.83,0:20:40.69,Main,,0,0,0,,You'd better still be there...Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.65,0:20:45.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.13,0:20:51.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, guards, keep these two in chains.Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:52.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.66,0:20:56.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't ever take the seastone handcuffs off of Nico Robin, okay?Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:21:00.41,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll take Cutty Flam to Impel Down and Nico Robin to Navy Headquarters.Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.41,0:21:02.30,Main,,0,0,0,,As soon as the escort ship is ready,Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:04.38,Main,,0,0,0,,we'll go through the Gates of Justice and sail off.Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.38,0:21:06.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! Understood, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:08.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Also...Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.52,0:21:11.10,Main,,0,0,0,,let me tell you guys one thing.Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.10,0:21:13.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam is violen–Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.71,0:21:18.63,Secondary,,0,0,80,,He's biting into my head! Hey, Kalifa!Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:16.71,Main,,0,0,0,,So Straw Hat showed up?Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.89,0:21:18.91,Main,,0,0,0,,That's sexual harassment.Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.91,0:21:19.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.93,0:21:24.08,Secondary,,0,0,80,,Hey! Hey! Someone! Someone! Help! Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.40,0:21:23.72,Main,,0,0,0,,A call came in earlier. Chapapa.Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:26.78,Secondary,,0,0,80,,What're you doing?! Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.72,0:21:26.78,Main,,0,0,0,,The chief was so upset, it was almost embarrassing.Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.44,0:21:29.14,Secondary,,0,0,80,,Let the chief go!Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.30,0:21:29.15,Main,,0,0,0,,But the report saidDialogue: 0,0:21:29.14,0:21:30.70,Secondary,,0,0,80,,Give up already, you bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.15,0:21:30.70,Main,,0,0,0,,that there were only five casualties then.Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.70,0:21:31.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:38.04,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The receiver is off the hook.Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:38.19,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:38.19,0:21:38.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:38.33,0:21:38.45,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:38.45,0:21:38.60,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:38.64,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:38.64,0:21:39.10,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.10,0:21:39.15,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.15,0:21:39.20,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.20,0:21:39.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:39.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.29,0:21:39.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.33,0:21:39.37,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.37,0:21:39.41,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.41,0:21:39.46,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:39.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:39.54,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.54,0:21:39.58,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.58,0:21:39.62,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.62,0:21:39.66,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.66,0:21:39.71,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.71,0:21:39.75,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:39.79,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:39.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.83,0:21:39.87,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.87,0:21:39.91,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.91,0:21:39.96,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:40.00,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:40.04,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:40.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:40.12,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:40.12,0:21:40.16,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:40.16,0:21:40.21,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:40.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:40.25,0:21:40.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:40.29,0:21:40.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:40.37,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:40.37,0:21:40.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:21:40.42,0:21:40.46,Captions,,0,0,0,,C