ons,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:38.33,0:21:38.64,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:38.64,0:21:39.00,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:39.05,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.05,0:21:39.10,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.10,0:21:39.15,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.15,0:21:39.20,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.20,0:21:39.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:39.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.29,0:21:39.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.33,0:21:39.37,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.37,0:21:39.41,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.41,0:21:39.46,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:39.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:39.54,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.54,0:21:39.58,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.58,0:21:39.62,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.62,0:21:39.66,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.66,0:21:39.71,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.71,0:21:39.75,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:39.79,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:39.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.83,0:21:39.87,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.87,0:21:39.91,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.91,0:21:39.96,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:40.00,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:40.04,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:40.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:40.12,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.12,0:21:40.16,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.16,0:21:40.21,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:40.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.25,0:21:40.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.29,0:21:40.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:40.37,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.37,0:21:40.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.42,0:21:40.46,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.46,0:21:40.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:40.54,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.54,0:21:40.58,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:40.62,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.62,0:21:40.67,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.67,0:21:40.71,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.71,0:21:40.75,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:40.79,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.79,0:21:40.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.83,0:21:40.87,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.87,0:21:40.92,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:40.96,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:40.96,0:21:41.00,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:41.00,0:21:41.04,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:41.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:41.08,0:21:41.12,Captions,,0,0,0,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:21:38.45,0:21:41.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-There's trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.70,0:21:42.55,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.55,0:21:44.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy...!Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:51.15,Main,,0,0,0,,We lost Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.15,0:21:54.73,Main,,0,0,0,,How could that be possible?! How many guards do you think there are?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.73,0:21:56.31,Main,,0,0,0,,But we can't find him anywhere!Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.00,0:22:00.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me... he's already inside the courthouse?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.75,0:22:03.96,Main,,0,0,0,,No, sir! We haven't let even a single bug through here!Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.29,0:22:09.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Find him! Find Straw Hat at any cost!Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.09,0:22:19.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That must be the last building.Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:24.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't give us trouble! Walk already!Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.33,0:22:39.87,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys go back to your rooms and take it easy for the time being.Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.87,0:22:45.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this, it's a sure thing that we, CP9, will see our status rise incredibly.Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.60,0:22:49.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't we drink a toast on the ship?Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.91,0:22:54.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like drinking a toast...Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.58,0:22:58.53,Main,,0,0,0,,since I'm not interested in status or authority.Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.53,0:22:59.37,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:04.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Our justice exists in the World Government.Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.33,0:23:08.21,Main,,0,0,0,,So long as the Government recognizes you as CP9's commander,Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.21,0:23:11.06,Main,,0,0,0,,we just fulfill our duty with perfection, that's all.Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.94,0:23:16.76,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't have to support your ideology.Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.39,0:23:20.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-That's a sound argument.Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.47,0:23:22.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Then what is it that you seek?Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.76,0:23:30.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Blood... perhaps.Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.03,0:23:43.45,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as we belong to CP9, even killing can be justified.Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.33,0:23:48.73,Main,,0,0,0,,They give me the creeps.Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.37,0:23:53.46,Main,,0,0,0,,They're, indeed, the only group of assassins in the Government.Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.79,0:23:58.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What dependable guys my subordinates are.Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.17,0:24:03.07,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as I have them, I feel like I can't lose!Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.72,0:24:12.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright.Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.21,0:24:16.54,Main,,0,0,0,,But there's no path.Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.54,0:24:19.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Although it's a bit far, I guess I'll try jumping.Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.30,0:24:20.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.13,0:24:25.72,Main,,0,0,0,,What the heck?Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.72,0:24:27.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Air DoorDialogue: 0,0:24:37.13,0:24:40.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah! You're that bull guy who was with the pigeon guy!Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.24,0:24:44.45,Main,,0,0,0,,The actual situation seems quite a bit different from the report...Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.45,0:24:47.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! How'd you do that?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.09,0:24:48.90,Main,,0,0,0,,That was amazing! Is that a magic trick?Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.90,0:24:53.75,Main,,0,0,0,,although I did think that there was no way there'd be only five casualties.Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.75,0:24:56.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Boy, that was a big surprise!Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.19,0:25:00.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Since the start of the World Government, it's unprecedented...Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.31,0:25:05.68,Main,,0,0,0,,for a man to step this far into the Government's entrance.Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.17,0:25:09.57,Main,,0,0,0,,How long are you planning to keep fighting?Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.47,0:25:24.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Until I die.[Aegisub Extradata]Data: 16,a-mo,eData: 19,a-mo,e